      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rivesville%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits at 39°31′49″N 80°7′9″W, on the north‑west bank of the Monongahela River near Paw Paw Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rivesville%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rivesville once hosted the Fairmont‑Clarksburg Division of the Monongahela‑West Pen Railways, linking it to regional trade.",
